===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|de|goh|mund}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*munþaz}}, from {{der|de|ine-pro|*ment-}}. Cognate with {{cog|nds|Mund}}, {{cog|nl|mond}}, {{cog|en|mouth}}, {{cog|da|mund}}.

